        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XS6ARsYb1etzcZC_o9MQ-14" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;Monitoring in dept&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;-&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;The server and workstations&#39;s logs are collected by the Alloy agent running on them. And it sends them to the Collector.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;- The collector forwards everything through the router and send it to Loki through the VPN&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- A Grafana alert rule over Loki counts failed logins per IP. When alert is present Grafana publishes it to SNS.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- SNS copies the alert into SQS.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- SQS waits for Lambda. Lambda matches the alert against rules and runs actions:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- CloudWatch is used as a data source that holds the health numbers&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Notify by SNS email&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Record incident in DynamoDB&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;- Block attacker&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="430" width="300" x="462.2" y="1020" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="XS6ARsYb1etzcZC_o9MQ-16" parent="1" style="points=[];aspect=fixed;html=1;align=center;shadow=0;dashed=0;fillColor=#FF6A00;strokeColor=none;shape=mxgraph.alibaba_cloud.dns_privatezone_01;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;DNS Private Zone&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
